type: software
title: "Delay Independent Safe Control with Neural Networks: Positive Lur'e Certificates (code)"
abstract: "Code for the ACC 2026 paper: certificates of local exponential stability for a linear plant with a feedforward neural network controller under state and input delays and interval-matrix uncertainty, using local sector bounds and positive Lur'e systems, benchmarked against an SDP-based IQC baseline."
